It is midday now.
I am taking a break in the office canteen.
The canteen is very bright.
I am eating my lunch.
I am eating spicy fish curry.
The fish curry is very tasty.
My colleague Prakash comes here.
Prakash sits at my table.
Prakash is talking to me.
He is telling a joke.
It is a good story.
I am laughing out loud.
Prakash also laughs happily.
Prakash is eating his food now.
We enjoy the food together.
I am drinking some water.
The break time ends.
We are going back to work.
